# Wave W17-I (Route 42): mill cairn — a waymark cairn of mountain stones with a round worn millstone leaning against it, the mountain’s namesake left at the roadside, on mill turf (fully opaque, ground baked in). The design’s road passes the mountain’s mouths; the cairns mark where it gives the road back.
